CM_ SG_ 615 DI_relativeTireTreadDepth "Reports estimate of tire wear ratio, represented in estimated tread depth difference between front and rear tires. A positive value indicates the rear tires are more worn than the front tires; raw 32 = signal not available (SNA)";
